{"id": "0ca50b6b-1d2a-49ef-8430-b24045b05bf1", "slug": "nexus-fluid-dynamics", "title": "Nexus · Fluid Dynamics", "description": "Nexus Fluid Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Nexus · Fluid Dynamics\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Fluid Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#34D399\"\n  secondary: \"#030504\"\n  accent: \"#96FFC8\"\n  background: \"#030504\"\n  surface: \"#103223\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus · Fluid Dynamics\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 17; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated.\n## Overview\nNexus Fluid Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNEXUS Initialize Interactive Background FLUID DYNAMICS A divergence-free curl-noise vector field advects thousands of additive particles into drifting currents. Move your cursor to push and shape the field in realtime.…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: FLUID DYNAMICS.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #34D399, secondary #030504, accent #96FFC8, background #030504, surface #103223, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and Geist Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use Geist Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover\" />\n    <title>Nexus · Fluid Dynamics</title>\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script type=\"importmap\">\n    {\n        \"imports\": {\n            \"three\": \"https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js\"\n        }\n    }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body id=\"stage\" class=\"bg-[#030504] text-[#e2e8f0] h-screen w-screen overflow-hidden relative antialiased selection:bg-emerald-500/20 cursor-crosshair\" style=\"font-family: 'Geist', 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- CSS Fallback Background -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(120% 95% at 28% 22%, rgba(16, 50, 35, 0.4), transparent 60%), radial-gradient(110% 110% at 78% 78%, rgba(5, 30, 20, 0.4), transparent 58%), linear-gradient(180deg, #030504 0%, #020302 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"gl\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full block pointer-events-none z-0\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Scanline Veil -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none opacity-30 mix-blend-overlay\" style=\"background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(150,255,200,0.03) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Corner Frame Elements -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none p-4 md:p-8\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 w-8 h-8 border-t border-l border-emerald-500/20 opacity-60 animate-pulse\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 w-8 h-8 border-t border-r border-emerald-500/20 opacity-60 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-delay: 1.5s;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-6 w-8 h-8 border-b border-l border-emerald-500/20 opacity-60 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-delay: 3s;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 right-6 w-8 h-8 border-b border-r border-emerald-500/20 opacity-60 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-delay: 4.5s;\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- UI Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20 flex flex-col justify-between p-6 md:p-10 pointer-events-none\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"flex justify-between items-center w-full\">\n            <div class=\"text-xs md:text-sm tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-medium text-white/70 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-emerald-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                NEXUS\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 pointer-events-auto\">\n                <div class=\"hidden md:flex -space-x-2 mr-2\">\n                    <img class=\"inline-block h-6 w-6 rounded-full ring-2 ring-[#030504] object-cover\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/0d868fef-f560-45ca-ab35-5dad4fc29059_3840w.webp\" alt=\"User\">\n                    <img class=\"inline-block h-6 w-6 rounded-full ring-2 ring-[#030504] object-cover\" src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/3186f9ea-5f5a-49f7-8fcf-568ad52f515e_3840w.webp\" alt=\"User\">\n                </div>\n                <!-- Gradient Border Button -->\n                <button class=\"relative rounded-full p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500/40 via-teal-400/20 to-emerald-500/40 hover:from-emerald-400/60 hover:to-emerald-400/60 transition-all duration-500\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#050806] rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-white/90 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        Initialize <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-emerald-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Center Hero -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 animate-pulse pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(50% 50% at 50% 50%, rgba(2, 6, 4, 0.7) 0%, transparent 80%); animation-duration: 8s;\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Eyebrow -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 md:mb-8\">\n                <div class=\"w-8 md:w-12 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-emerald-500/40 to-transparent\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)] animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 2s;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-white/50 font-mono\" style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;\">Interactive Background</div>\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)] animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 2s;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-8 md:w-12 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-emerald-500/40 to-transparent\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Title with Masked Reveal -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[9rem] font-semibold tracking-tighter text-white leading-[0.9] flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-2 md:gap-x-4 mb-6 md:mb-10 w-full max-w-6xl\">\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block px-1 pb-2\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block transform translate-y-full reveal-word\">FLUID</span>\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block px-1 pb-2\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block transform translate-y-full reveal-word text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-emerald-100 to-emerald-600\">DYNAMICS</span>\n                </span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Subtitle -->\n            <p class=\"max-w-md md:max-w-lg text-xs md:text-base text-white/50 leading-relaxed font-light reveal-sub opacity-0 transform translate-y-4\">\n                A divergence-free curl-noise vector field advects thousands of additive particles into drifting currents. <strong class=\"text-white font-medium\">Move your cursor</strong> to push and shape the field in realtime.\n            </p>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Row -->\n        <footer class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center w-full gap-6 md:gap-0\">\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-white/30 font-mono hidden md:block\" style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;\">\n                <span class=\"text-white/60\">System</span> · Environment\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- HUD -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 md:gap-4 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/10 bg-[#020403]/80 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_8px_30px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,1),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] pointer-events-none\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[10px] tracking-wider font-mono text-white/40\">\n                    PRTCL <span class=\"text-white/90 tabular-nums min-w-[3.5ch] text-right\" id=\"pCount\">0</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"w-px h-3.5 bg-white/10\"></div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[10px] tracking-wider font-mono text-white/40\">\n                    FIELD <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">CURL</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"w-px h-3.5 bg-white/10\"></div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[10px] tracking-wider font-mono text-white/40\">\n                    FPS <span class=\"text-white/90 tabular-nums min-w-[2ch] text-right\" id=\"pFps\">--</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-white/30 font-mono md:hidden\" style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;\">\n                <span class=\"text-white/60\">Nexus</span> · V.1.0\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- GSAP Animation Logic -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 1.4,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n            gsap.to(\".reveal-sub\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.8\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Particle System -->\n    <script type=\"module\">\n        import * as THREE from \"three\";\n\n        const stage = document.getElementById(\"stage\");\n        const canvas = document.getElementById(\"gl\");\n        const elCount = document.getElementById(\"pCount\");\n        const elFps = document.getElementById(\"pFps\");\n\n        const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches;\n        const isMobile = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia(\"(max-width: 640px)\").matches;\n\n        let renderer;\n        try {\n            renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({\n                canvas, alpha: true, antialias: false,\n                powerPreference: \"high-performance\",\n                failIfMajorPerformanceCaveat: false\n            });\n        } catch (e) {\n            canvas.style.display = \"none\";\n        }\n\n        if (renderer) {\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 1.75));\n            renderer.autoClear = false;\n\n            const COUNT = isMobile ? 2200 : 4200;\n            const minDraw = isMobile ? 320 : 450;\n            let drawCount = isMobile ? 600 : 1000;\n            elCount.textContent = drawCount.toLocaleString();\n\n            let aspect = stage.clientWidth / Math.max(1, stage.clientHeight);\n            const mainCam = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-aspect, aspect, 1, -1, 0, 10);\n            mainCam.position.z = 2;\n\n            const bgCam = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 10);\n            bgCam.position.z = 1;\n\n            const bgScene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const bgUniforms = {\n                uTime: { value: 0 },\n                uRes: { value: new THREE.Vector2(1, 1) },\n                uMouse: { value: new THREE.Vector2(0, 0) }\n            };\n\n            const bgMat = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                uniforms: bgUniforms,\n                depthTest: false, depthWrite: false,\n                vertexShader: `\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    void main(){ vUv = uv; gl_Position = vec4(position.xy, 0.0, 1.0); }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    precision mediump float;\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    uniform float uTime; uniform vec2 uRes; uniform vec2 uMouse;\n\n                    float hash(vec2 p){\n                        p = fract(p * vec2(123.34, 456.21));\n                        p += dot(p, p + 45.32);\n                        return fract(p.x * p.y);\n                    }\n                    float noise(vec2 p){\n                        vec2 i = floor(p), f = fract(p);\n                        vec2 u = f*f*(3.0-2.0*f);\n                        float a = hash(i), b = hash(i+vec2(1,0));\n                        float c = hash(i+vec2(0,1)), d = hash(i+vec2(1,1));\n                        return mix(mix(a,b,u.x), mix(c,d,u.x), u.y);\n                    }\n                    void main(){\n                        vec2 uv = vUv;\n                        vec2 p = uv - 0.5;\n                        p.x *= uRes.x / max(uRes.y, 1.0);\n\n                        float t = uTime * 0.045;\n                        float n = noise(p*2.0 + vec2(t, -t*0.6));\n\n                        // Modified palette for dark emerald theme\n                        vec3 deep = vec3(0.005, 0.015, 0.010);\n                        vec3 mid  = vec3(0.012, 0.040, 0.025);\n                        vec3 col  = mix(deep, mid, smoothstep(0.15, 0.88, n));\n\n                        float md = length(p - uMouse);\n                        col += vec3(0.05, 0.25, 0.15) * smoothstep(0.85, 0.0, md) * 0.45;\n\n                        float vig = smoothstep(1.35, 0.25, length(uv - 0.5));\n                        col *= mix(0.5, 1.0, vig);\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(col, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `\n            });\n            const bgQuad = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2), bgMat);\n            bgQuad.frustumCulled = false;\n            bgScene.add(bgQuad);\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const positions = new Float32Array(COUNT * 3);\n            const colors = new Float32Array(COUNT * 3);\n            const sizes = new Float32Array(COUNT);\n            const alphas = new Float32Array(COUNT);\n\n            const velX = new Float32Array(COUNT);\n            const velY = new Float32Array(COUNT);\n            const life = new Float32Array(COUNT);\n            const maxLife = new Float32Array(COUNT);\n\n            // Emerald theme particle palette\n            const cA = new THREE.Color(0x059669); // Emerald\n            const cB = new THREE.Color(0xa7f3d0); // Light Emerald\n            const cC = new THREE.Color(0xffffff); // White\n            const tmpCol = new THREE.Color();\n\n            function rampColor(s){\n                if (s < 0.6) tmpCol.copy(cA).lerp(cB, s / 0.6);\n                else         tmpCol.copy(cB).lerp(cC, (s - 0.6) / 0.4);\n                return tmpCol;\n            }\n\n            function spawn(i, fresh){\n                const ax = aspect;\n                positions[i*3+0] = (Math.random()*2 - 1) * ax;\n                positions[i*3+1] = (Math.random()*2 - 1);\n                positions[i*3+2] = 0;\n                velX[i] = 0; velY[i] = 0;\n                life[i] = fresh ? Math.random() * 1.0 : 0;\n                maxLife[i] = 5 + Math.random() * 7;\n\n                const seed = Math.random();\n                const c = rampColor(seed);\n                colors[i*3+0] = c.r; colors[i*3+1] = c.g; colors[i*3+2] = c.b;\n                sizes[i] = (2.0 + Math.random()*4.0) * renderer.getPixelRatio();\n                alphas[i] = 0;\n            }\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < COUNT; i++) spawn(i, true);\n\n            const geo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const posAttr = new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3);\n            const colAttr = new THREE.BufferAttribute(colors, 3);\n            const sizeAttr = new THREE.BufferAttribute(sizes, 1);\n            const alphaAttr = new THREE.BufferAttribute(alphas, 1);\n\n            posAttr.setUsage(THREE.DynamicDrawUsage);\n            alphaAttr.setUsage(THREE.DynamicDrawUsage);\n\n            geo.setAttribute(\"position\", posAttr);\n            geo.setAttribute(\"aColor\", colAttr);\n            geo.setAttribute(\"aSize\", sizeAttr);\n            geo.setAttribute(\"aAlpha\", alphaAttr);\n            geo.setDrawRange(0, drawCount);\n\n            const pMat = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                transparent: true,\n                depthTest: false, depthWrite: false,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\n                uniforms: { uGlow: { value: 1.1 } },\n                vertexShader: `\n                    attribute vec3 aColor;\n                    attribute float aSize;\n                    attribute float aAlpha;\n                    varying vec3 vColor; varying float vAlpha;\n                    void main(){\n                        vColor = aColor; vAlpha = aAlpha;\n                        vec4 mv = modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\n                        gl_Position = projectionMatrix * mv;\n                        gl_PointSize = aSize;\n                    }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    precision highp float;\n                    varying vec3 vColor; varying float vAlpha;\n                    uniform float uGlow;\n                    void main(){\n                        vec2 d = gl_PointCoord - 0.5;\n                        float r = length(d);\n                        float core = smoothstep(0.5, 0.0, r);\n                        core = core * core;\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(vColor * uGlow, core * vAlpha);\n                    }\n                `\n            });\n            const points = new THREE.Points(geo, pMat);\n            points.frustumCulled = false;\n            scene.add(points);\n\n            function hash3(x, y, z){\n                let n = (x|0)*374761393 + (y|0)*668265263 + (z|0)*1274126177;\n                n = (n ^ (n >>> 13)) | 0;\n                n = (n * 1274126177) | 0;\n                n = (n ^ (n >>> 16)) >>> 0;\n                return n / 4294967295;\n            }\n\n            function vnoise(x, y, z){\n                const xi = Math.floor(x), yi = Math.floor(y), zi = Math.floor(z);\n                const xf = x-xi, yf = y-yi, zf = z-zi;\n                const u = xf*xf*(3-2*xf), v = yf*yf*(3-2*yf), w = zf*zf*(3-2*zf);\n                const c000=hash3(xi,yi,zi),     c100=hash3(xi+1,yi,zi);\n                const c010=hash3(xi,yi+1,zi),   c110=hash3(xi+1,yi+1,zi);\n                const c001=hash3(xi,yi,zi+1),   c101=hash3(xi+1,yi,zi+1);\n                const c011=hash3(xi,yi+1,zi+1), c111=hash3(xi+1,yi+1,zi+1);\n                const x00=c000+(c100-c000)*u, x10=c010+(c110-c010)*u;\n                const x01=c001+(c101-c001)*u, x11=c011+(c111-c011)*u;\n                const y0=x00+(x10-x00)*v, y1=x01+(x11-x01)*v;\n                return y0+(y1-y0)*w;\n            }\n\n            const FREQ = 1.35;\n            const EPS  = 0.02;\n            const INV2E = 1 / EPS;\n\n            function curl(x, y, t, out){\n                const fx = x*FREQ, fy = y*FREQ;\n                const fe = EPS*FREQ;\n                const p0 = vnoise(fx, fy, t);\n                const px = vnoise(fx+fe, fy, t);\n                const py = vnoise(fx, fy+fe, t);\n                out[0] =  (py - p0) * INV2E;\n                out[1] = -(px - p0) * INV2E;\n            }\n\n            const mouse = new THREE.Vector2(0, 0);\n            const mPrev = new THREE.Vector2(0, 0);\n            let mActive = 0;\n            let mSpeed = 0;\n\n            function setMouseFromEvent(e){\n                const r = stage.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const px = (e.clientX - r.left) / r.width;\n                const py = (e.clientY - r.top) / r.height;\n                mPrev.copy(mouse);\n                mouse.x = (px * 2 - 1) * aspect;\n                mouse.y = -(py * 2 - 1);\n                const dx = mouse.x - mPrev.x, dy = mouse.y - mPrev.y;\n                mSpeed = Math.min(1.0, Math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy) * 6.0);\n                mActive = 1.0;\n            }\n\n            stage.addEventListener(\"pointermove\", setMouseFromEvent, { passive: true });\n            stage.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\", (e) => { setMouseFromEvent(e); mActive = 1.4; }, { passive: true });\n            stage.addEventListener(\"pointerleave\", () => { mActive = 0; });\n\n            function resize(){\n                const w = stage.clientWidth, h = Math.max(1, stage.clientHeight);\n                aspect = w / h;\n                mainCam.left = -aspect; mainCam.right = aspect;\n                mainCam.top = 1; mainCam.bottom = -1;\n                mainCam.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(w, h, false);\n                const dpr = renderer.getPixelRatio();\n                bgUniforms.uRes.value.set(w * dpr, h * dpr);\n            }\n\n            const FORCE_R = 0.5;\n            const PUSH = 0.9;\n            const SWIRL = 0.7;\n            const FLOW = 0.22;\n            const DAMP = 0.86;\n            const cv = [0, 0];\n\n            function simulate(dt, t){\n                const bound = aspect + 0.25;\n                const mx = mouse.x, my = mouse.y;\n                const forceOn = mActive > 0.001;\n                const fScale = (0.4 + mSpeed) * Math.min(mActive, 1.5);\n                let respawned = false;\n\n                for (let i = 0; i < drawCount; i++){\n                    const ix = i*3;\n                    let x = positions[ix], y = positions[ix+1];\n\n                    curl(x, y, t, cv);\n                    let tx = cv[0] * FLOW;\n                    let ty = cv[1] * FLOW;\n\n                    if (forceOn){\n                        const ddx = x - mx, ddy = y - my;\n                        const dist = Math.sqrt(ddx*ddx + ddy*ddy) + 1e-4;\n                        if (dist < FORCE_R){\n                            const fall = (1 - dist / FORCE_R);\n                            const f = fall * fall * fScale;\n                            const nx = ddx / dist, ny = ddy / dist;\n                            tx += nx * PUSH * f;\n                            ty += ny * PUSH * f;\n                            tx += -ny * SWIRL * f;\n                            ty +=  nx * SWIRL * f;\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    let vx = velX[i] * DAMP + tx * (1 - DAMP);\n                    let vy = velY[i] * DAMP + ty * (1 - DAMP);\n\n                    const sp = Math.sqrt(vx*vx + vy*vy);\n                    const MAXV = 2.2;\n                    if (sp > MAXV){ const k = MAXV / sp; vx *= k; vy *= k; }\n                    velX[i] = vx; velY[i] = vy;\n\n                    x += vx * dt; y += vy * dt;\n\n                    life[i] += dt;\n                    const lf = life[i], ml = maxLife[i];\n                    let a;\n                    const fin = 0.14 * ml, fout = 0.35 * ml;\n\n                    if (lf < fin) a = lf / fin;\n                    else if (lf > ml - fout) a = Math.max(0, (ml - lf) / fout);\n                    else a = 1.0;\n\n                    alphas[i] = Math.min(1.0, a * (0.62 + Math.min(sp, 1.5) * 0.42));\n\n                    if (lf > ml || x < -bound || x > bound || y < -1.25 || y > 1.25){\n                        spawn(i, false);\n                        respawned = true;\n                    } else {\n                        positions[ix] = x; positions[ix+1] = y;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                posAttr.needsUpdate = true;\n                alphaAttr.needsUpdate = true;\n                if (respawned){ colAttr.needsUpdate = true; sizeAttr.needsUpdate = true; }\n            }\n\n            function renderScene(){\n                renderer.clear();\n                renderer.render(bgScene, bgCam);\n                renderer.render(scene, mainCam);\n            }\n\n            let raf = 0, running = false, last = 0;\n            let fpsAccum = 0, fpsFrames = 0;\n\n            function loop(now){\n                if (!running) return;\n                let dt = (now - last) / 1000;\n                last = now;\n                if (dt > 0.05) dt = 0.05;\n                if (dt <= 0) dt = 0.016;\n\n                const t = now * 0.00015;\n                bgUniforms.uTime.value = now * 0.001;\n                bgUniforms.uMouse.value.set(mouse.x * (mActive > 0 ? 1 : 0), mouse.y * (mActive > 0 ? 1 : 0));\n\n                mActive *= 0.94; mSpeed *= 0.9;\n\n                simulate(dt, t);\n                renderScene();\n\n                fpsFrames++; fpsAccum += dt;\n                if (fpsAccum >= 0.4){\n                    const fps = fpsFrames / fpsAccum;\n                    if (elFps) elFps.textContent = Math.round(fps);\n                    let changed = false;\n                    if (fps < 54 && drawCount > minDraw){\n                        drawCount = Math.max(minDraw, Math.floor(drawCount * 0.78));\n                        changed = true;\n                    } else if (fps > 59 && drawCount < COUNT){\n                        drawCount = Math.min(COUNT, drawCount + 300);\n                        changed = true;\n                    }\n                    if (changed){\n                        geo.setDrawRange(0, drawCount);\n                        if (elCount) elCount.textContent = drawCount.toLocaleString();\n                    }\n                    fpsAccum = 0; fpsFrames = 0;\n                }\n                raf = requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n            }\n\n            function play(){\n                if (running || prefersReduced) return;\n                running = true; last = performance.now();\n                raf = requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n            }\n\n            function pause(){\n                running = false;\n                if (raf){ cancelAnimationFrame(raf); raf = 0; }\n            }\n\n            function staticFrame(){\n                bgUniforms.uTime.value = 6.0;\n                bgUniforms.uMouse.value.set(0, 0);\n                for (let s = 0; s < 60; s++) simulate(0.05, 0.4);\n                for (let i = 0; i < drawCount; i++) alphas[i] = Math.min(1, alphas[i] + 0.4);\n                alphaAttr.needsUpdate = true;\n                renderScene();\n                if (elFps) elFps.textContent = \"—\";\n            }\n\n            let resizeQueued = false;\n            function onResize(){\n                if (resizeQueued) return;\n                resizeQueued = true;\n                requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n                    resizeQueued = false;\n                    resize();\n                    if (!running) renderScene();\n                });\n            }\n            window.addEventListener(\"resize\", onResize);\n\n            document.addEventListener(\"visibilitychange\", () => {\n                if (document.hidden) pause(); else play();\n            });\n\n            resize();\n            if (prefersReduced){\n                staticFrame();\n            } else {\n                renderScene();\n                play();\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-fluid-dynamics.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/nexus-fluid-dynamics.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-fluid-dynamics-DESIGN.md", "views": 31, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T00:08:56.669858+00:00"}